From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Market Canopy <office@marketcanopy.invalid>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] No AI chat on the start screen; no AI Tools page

Office's AI is the AI plugin inside documents (ADR 0525 as amended on
2026-10-27): the start screen offers no AI chat. Upstream shows the
bundled agent only in its own branded builds (OO_BRANDING, which
build_tools never defines), so the start page never learns the agent is
there and draws no AI side panel; the AI chat menu item and the recent
files' "add to AI chat" actions, which would otherwise ask to install
the vendor's add-on, are removed.

The AI Tools item opened the add-on's tool gallery, which Office does
not have, so it is removed too.
